>>
Rule 6 (repeats should be less than the size of the tensor)
{a : tensor, repeats : int, axis : int} |= repeats ≤ shape(a, axis)
>>
Rule 22 (if repeats is greater than 0, axis must be less than or equal to the number of dimensions of the tensor)
{a : tensor, repeats : int, axis : int} |= (repeats > 0) ∧ (axis ≤ ndim(a))
>>
Rule 31 (if repeats is greater than 1, the output tensor's shape along the specified axis is scaled by repeats)
{a : tensor, repeats : int, axis : int} |= if repeats > 1 then shape(a, axis) > 0
